WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-After Nike announced
that former NFL quarterback

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
and activist Colin Kaepernick
would be the face

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
of its new ad campaign,
angry consumers

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
began posting photos
of themselves

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
burning their
Nike shoes and apparel.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:12.379
Now, this story obviously has
some strong racial overtones,

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm not sure I'm
comfortable commenting on it.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I am!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:20.620 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, here's the thing,
white people.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not saying you don't have
a right to protest.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:29.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just saying you're doing
it the wrong way.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:30.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why not burn your
shoes privately,

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.967
instead of putting it on the
Internet for everyone to see?

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:37.203
Why are you disrespecting
the hard-working people of Nike?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I don't think
that's what they're --

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:41.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Protest is a right guaranteed
under the constitution,

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
but there is a
time and place for that.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:47.113
And the Internet is neither
the time, nor the place.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:47.614 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It's not?

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm tired of you people
politicizing shoes.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:52.385 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Oh, wait, wait. I see.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're just saying all
the stuff white people said

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:56.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
when Kaepernick
was kneeling, aren't you?

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.359 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-You're damn right I am!

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.927 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Whoo! Go ahead.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:03.063 line:92%
Burn your shoes, you dummies.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:07.267
And if you don't have any Nikes,
take your ass down to the ATM,

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.502 line:92%
take out $140, and burn that.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:12.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whoo!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.441 line:92%
-Amber Ruffin, everybody!

